// The team's norms (vault designs/policy-language-draft-2026-11-08.md §3), compiled by coordd policy/norms.rs. coordd
// asks them on each `coord msg` an agent sends and on each `coord log`; the owner is not bound by them.

// One agent mailing another (owner, 9 Nov): anyone may mail anyone, except a consultant, whose mail is advice its
// members do not answer. A member who disagrees takes it to their lead, who may answer the consultant; anyone may
// answer it in a thread the owner brought the consultant into.
Act send-mail
  Actor agent
  Recipient agent
  Related to thread
  Holds when not role(recipient, "consultant")
  Holds when role(actor, "lead")
  Holds when role(actor, "consultant")
  Holds when brought-in(recipient, thread)

// Reading another agent's session beyond those below you (`coord log`; the agents above one always may): the
// consultant reads everyone's, as it advises the whole team.
Act read-session
  Actor agent
  Recipient agent
  Holds when role(actor, "consultant")
